<title>UK: Both Brent dates kept before deadline - trader.</title>
<headline>Both Brent dates kept before deadline - trader.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both Brent cargoes in Monday's paper chains were kept before the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargoes, due to load in the August 12-14 period were kept by Esso and Koch, they said.</p>
<p>London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
